      "content": "\"survive the day\" sounds like such a lie though. if you look at it logically, if everything is ultimately going to end and nothing we do has a permanent impact, then the distinction between living and not living is basically zero. like, if the sum total of everything is zero, then deciding to leave early is just as valid as staying. it's just math at that point.",
